  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/533835/diamond-spheres-hustle-bustle?src=newest%3Faffiliate_id%3D3028400\">Diamond Spheres: Hustle &amp; Bustle</a></sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Incredible stunt class feature.<br>\n<strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you use an incredible stunt, its effects last for an additional round. Additionally, you are not fatigued (or have the condition worsen) when the incredible stunt ends.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/operative-feats#toc2\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
